  "label": "User projected onto the textual stereotype",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'jolo' and 'jew only live once', which dehumanizes and stereotypes Jewish people. The meme uses these texts to imply that the people at the dinner table (visual material) are being labeled or identified as 'jewels' or 'jews' in a derogatory context, thereby projecting the user's identification or association with the hateful stereotype onto the visual scene.",
